<title>USA: American Eco sees Q4 EPS meeting estimates.</title>
<headline>American Eco sees Q4 EPS meeting estimates.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>American ECO Corp said Monday that it expected to match analysts' share earnings estimates for the third quarter and full year.</p>
<p>Michael McGinnis, president and chief executive, said in a telephone conference that he was &quot;highly confident&quot; the company would meet analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>Analysts  estimated American ECO earnings per share at $0.20 for the fourth quarter and $0.80 for the year.</p>
